  <data name="WaitingLocation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The lake, northern Sweden. 23:47. It is snowing.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingBody1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Someone has left the radio on. It crackles. Someone, or something, is trying to reach you.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingBody2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You can't remember who you are. Perhaps that's for the best. For now.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingOpens" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The first door opens on December 1st.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingUntil" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Until then: put on your woolly socks, refill the coffee and do not leave the cabin.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingAside" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(And if you hear something big outside the window: it's surely just the snow.)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WaitingScan" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>[ Scanning frequency... 88.1 ... 91.4 ... 101.0 ... ]</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DeskPlaceholder" xml:space="preserve">
