  <data name="Day1_Memory" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You wake up by the radio. The coffee is on the table and a jacket hangs over the chair. You wonder whether you are the one who left these things here, or whether someone else lives here. Something crackles in the static.</value>
  </data>
